 consumption\n  reports.\n- HLR-3 (P1) — current-month consumption against each project's Kueue quota;\n  rendered inside the same admin view as the P0 report, so delivered with it\n  rather than as a separate epic.\n\n## Risks / Notes\n\n- The exact data-access surface (reporting API vs. a Kubernetes-native\n  surface) must respect the Dashboard's Kubernetes-API-only interface\n  constraint documented in its architecture context; this is an implementation\n  decision for the Dashboard team.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":47027,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b578be8699c1736d","agent_id":"aa596b517219ccaf0","session_id":"17116bf2-6a20-4da5-9984-1c3653ad446c","uuid":"cb756e47-d0fc-46cc-88a0-4da1547f74f0","timestamp":"2026-10-25T20:28:05.039Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9018"}
