e reporting API.\n51\t- Administrator-scoped access following the Dashboard's existing\n52\t  authentication and RBAC patterns.\n53\t\n54\t## Acceptance Criteria\n55\t\n56\t- Administrators can view per-project GPU-hour consumption reports over\n57\t  selectable time ranges in the Dashboard.\n58\t- The admin view shows each project's current-month consumption against its\n59\t  Kueue quota.\n60\t- The view is reachable and usable only by administrator-scoped users,\n61\t  following the Dashboard's existing RBAC model.\n62\t- The Dashboard build/CI pipeline remains green.\n63\t\n64\t## HLR Traceability\n65\t\n66\t- HLR-1 (P0) — the administrator-facing view portion of the consumption\n67\t  reports.\n68\t- HLR-3 (P1) — current-month consumption against each project's Kueue quota;\n69\t  rendered inside the same admin view as the P0 report, so delivered with it\n70\t  rather than as a separate epic.\n71\t\n72\t## Risks / Notes\n73\t\n74\t- The exact data-access surface (reporting API vs. a Kubernetes-native\n75\t  surface) must respect the Dashboard's Kubernetes-API-only interface\n76\t  constraint documented in its architecture context; this is an implementation\n77\t  decision for the Dashboard team.\n78\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9e56fc9759bbf85d","agent_id":"add6bbde06547dd45","session_id":"17116bf2-6a20-4da5-9984-1c3653ad446c","uuid":"217d72c5-3dfc-40d0-93b3-898cd51a517d","timestamp":"2026-10-25T20:29:59.813Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-a50d9769948cd693","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9018 decomposition"}
